---

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

import neverending from '../assets/neverending.jpeg';

import Image from 'astro/components/Image.astro';
---

<Layout>

    <div class="neverending">
        <Image src={neverending} alt="neverending"/>
        <p>
            ‘a neverending conversation in a room that is actually not a room but a busy café’ is a website that resulted from an investigation into dialogue as a writing form. As the dialogue grew, the complexity of a conversation became apparent, and so I started writing multiple possible endings, integrating vague references, and adding to the dialogue the underlying knowledge bases of the people in conversation. This I could represent best in a website that allows the possibility of digressing, looping and linking through.
        </p>
        <p><a href="https://endlessconversation.hotglue.me/" target="_blank">You can visit the website here.</a></p>
        <br><br>
    </div>


</Layout>